# COSMIC desktop (System76; Fedora's packages) — installed on top of the base
# (system/config/packages.list) by the builder's dnf (system stage 7), weak
# dependencies off. Comments and blank lines are ignored.

# ── COSMIC (Wayland) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# cosmic-session pulls in the compositor, panel, launcher, app library,
# settings, files, the greeter (cosmic-greeter on greetd) and the portal.
cosmic-session
cosmic-greeter
cosmic-files
cosmic-settings
cosmic-settings-daemon
cosmic-icon-theme
# No terminal and no Flatpak store: cosmic-term and cosmic-initial-setup are
# required by cosmic-session and removed again (remove.list); COSMIC Store
# (Flatpak) is never installed — the app manager is Sawmill (AppImages).

# Removable drives, phones and network shares in COSMIC Files (as GNOME's).
gvfs
gvfs-fuse
gvfs-smb
gvfs-mtp
gvfs-gphoto2
gvfs-afc
gvfs-nfs

# ── Portal ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
xdg-desktop-portal-cosmic
